# Nog gains "You may play lands from your graveyard" and "You may play an additional land on each of your turns" from his
# {3} ability's effect (CR 613.1f), not from being an Officer. Arcane Adaptation naming Officer makes the Rogue Nog an
# Officer too (CR 205.1b), but he has neither ability: on turn 3, with no land played yet, Fabled Passage in the graveyard
# is not offered, and once an Island is played a second one is not. Then {1} makes him a Ferengi Scout and {3} an Officer
# that gains both: the second Island stays in hand and Fabled Passage is played from the graveyard as the extra land.

